<%- include('header') %>

<div class="page-header pitch-header animate-fade-in">
    <div>
        <h1>音域 / Key 建議</h1>
        <p>用本機麥克風測量自己的舒適音域，再和本機參考音檔比較。</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div id="pitch-lab" class="pitch-lab animate-fade-in">
    <div class="pitch-privacy glass-panel">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
        <span>音訊只在這個瀏覽器本機分析，不會上傳麥克風或音檔。結果是建議，不是能力判定。</span>
    </div>

    <div class="pitch-grid">
        <section class="pitch-card glass-panel" aria-labelledby="pitch-mic-title">
            <h2 id="pitch-mic-title">1. 測量你的音域</h2>
            <p class="pitch-help">按下開始後唱幾個舒服的低音與高音；不要憋氣或硬推。</p>
            <div class="pitch-actions">
                <button type="button" class="game-btn-primary" id="pitch-mic-start">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-microphone"></i> 開始測量
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="game-btn-secondary" id="pitch-mic-stop" disabled>
                    停止
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="game-btn-secondary" id="pitch-mic-save" disabled>
                    儲存音域
                </button>
            </div>
            <p id="pitch-mic-status" class="pitch-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">尚未開始麥克風測量</p>
            <p id="pitch-mic-latency" class="pitch-meta">麥克風：尚未啟用</p>
            <div id="pitch-range-summary" class="pitch-summary">尚無音域資料</div>
        </section>

        <section class="pitch-card glass-panel" aria-labelledby="pitch-reference-title">
            <h2 id="pitch-reference-title">2. 匯入本機參考音檔</h2>
            <p class="pitch-help">請選擇本機音檔；人聲越乾淨，Key 建議越可靠。</p>
            <label class="pitch-file-label" for="pitch-reference-file">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-file-audio"></i> 選擇音檔
            </label>
            <input id="pitch-reference-file" type="file" accept="audio/*" class="pitch-file-input">
            <p id="pitch-reference-status" class="pitch-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">尚未匯入參考音檔</p>
            <div id="pitch-reference-summary" class="pitch-summary">尚無參考曲線</div>
        </section>
    </div>

    <section class="pitch-card pitch-chart-card glass-panel" aria-labelledby="pitch-chart-title">
        <div class="pitch-card-heading">
            <div>
                <h2 id="pitch-chart-title">3. 比較音高曲線</h2>
                <p class="pitch-help">手動調整參考音檔位置；不會改變播放或歌詞時間。</p>
            </div>
            <label class="pitch-offset-label" for="pitch-alignment">
                時間偏移
                <input id="pitch-alignment" type="number" min="-60000" max="60000" step="100" value="0">
                <span>ms</span>
            </label>
        </div>
        <canvas id="pitch-canvas" class="pitch-canvas" aria-label="本機音高曲線"></canvas>
        <div class="pitch-legend">
            <span><i class="pitch-dot pitch-dot-mic"></i>你的測量</span>
            <span><i class="pitch-dot pitch-dot-reference"></i>參考音檔</span>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pitch-card glass-panel" aria-labelledby="pitch-advisor-title">
        <div class="pitch-card-heading">
            <div>
                <h2 id="pitch-advisor-title">4. Key Advisor</h2>
                <p class="pitch-help">只比較 -6 到 +6；播放器目前不會因這裡的操作而實際變調。</p>
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="game-btn-primary" id="pitch-apply-key" disabled>套用到比較曲線</button>
        </div>
        <p id="pitch-recommendation" class="pitch-recommendation">需要音域與參考音檔後才會產生建議。</p>
        <p id="pitch-applied" class="pitch-status"></p>
        <div class="pitch-table-wrap">
            <table class="pitch-table">
                <thead>
                    <tr><th>Key</th><th>舒適音域外</th><th>絕對音域外</th><th>分數</th></tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="pitch-candidates"></tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>

<script src="/js/pitch-analysis.js?v=1"></script>
<script src="/js/karaoke-microphone.js?v=1"></script>
<script src="/js/pitch-lab.js?v=1"></script>
<%- include('footer') %>
